    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In case of unforeseen incidents like accidents or delays, it is essential to have comprehensive insurance coverage for your belongings. IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance ensures that in case of any damage or loss during transportation, you are protected with a declared value of your goods.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>While ensuring the required statutory transit paperwork is crucial, it is equally important to have adequate risk coverage to protect your valuable belongings during transit. Packers and movers offering comprehensive risk coverage typically offer:</p>

